<title>USA: BDM unit awarded U.S. defense contract.</title>
<headline>BDM unit awarded U.S. defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BDM International Inc said Friday that a subsidiary had been awarded an $81 million U.S. Army contract at the Fort Polk, La., military training center.</p>
<p>The subsidiary, BDM Federal Inc, was awarded the five-year contract with Lockheed Martin Services Co, a unit of Lockheed Martin Corp.</p>
<p>The two companies will be providing total mission support to the center, including training requirements analysis, development of training strategies and support for live and simulation-based training.</p>
